\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">名词</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"10109643\"><ruby>名詞<rp>(</rp><rt>めいし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>修飾<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうしょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するものは、<ruby>形容詞<rp>(</rp><rt>けいようし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>または<ruby>形容詞相当語句<rp>(</rp><rt>けいようしそうとうごく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">改变名词的东西是形容词或相当于形容词。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">名所</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めいしょ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">名胜；名地；风景名胜地；景点</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"215148\">スイスには<ruby>名所<rp>(</rp><rt>めいしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">瑞士有很多景点。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/9012245\" title=\"Tatoeba · jacintoo\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · jacintoo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">迷信</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めいしん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">迷信；迷信的信念</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"138297\"><ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くの<ruby>迷信<rp>(</rp><rt>めいしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がまだ<ruby>信<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じられている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">许多迷信仍然被相信。</span></div></li>","<l